      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should take those 100mg Macrobid capsules twice daily, but only if your doctor specifically cleared that exact dosage for your stage 3 kidney disease, as standard dosing is often adjusted for renal function. Taking Advil (ibuprofen) is a bad idea because it can further damage your kidneys and interact dangerously with your current meds. You need to stop this self-medication immediately and see a professional to get a proper prescription tailored to your health status.",
