      "content": "i'm just really worried about the infection spreading to my kidneys if i wait a whole week, that sounds way scarier than just taking a pill. my doctor actually said previously that a single dose of an antibiotic might be okay to bridge the gap, and they didn't mention anything about it being life-threatening. are you sure it's that dangerous? i feel like i'm just being overly cautious with the macrobid, surely 100mg isn't going to cause acute kidney injury on its own?",
